| **Scan subdomains first** (subfinder + httpx) | Discover mail.example.org, vpn.example.org, etc. before scanning. More IPs = more coverage. | **Free** (open source) |
| **Shodan domain search** | Instead of just looking up resolved IPs, search Shodan for all IPs associated with the organization's domain | **Already have** (included in Shodan membership) |

